# Beril

Read `AGENTS.md` and `SKILL.md` before a security task.

## Commands

```bash
./beril scan --target <url-or-path>
./beril scan --target <binary> --deep
./beril re --target <binary>
./beril labs --run
```

## Rules

- Confirm target and authorization first.
- Read-only scan, then one manual class at a time.
- Static before dynamic. No execution of unknown binaries without a snapshot.
- A scanner hit is a lead. Replay it.
- Report with `references/dossier-template.md`.
- Label confirmed and inferred. Keep evidence paths.
- Stop at the agreed proof.
